1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,530
Dad, stop using one chat for 3 weeks.

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:06,330
That chat knows the diner. We've been through things.

3
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:09,370
It's 400 messages long! It's losing the early ones.

4
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:10,370
It forgets?

5
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:14,040
Every model can only hold so much. Your first instructions fade.

6
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:17,040
That's why it forgot we close Mondays.

7
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:20,400
Ask for a summary. Paste it into a new chat.

8
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:24,200
A summary of 3 weeks. Like my tax return.

9
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:27,870
Fresh chat, sharp brain! New dish: the Clean Slate Short Stack.

10
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:30,470
Okay. New chat every 3 weeks.

